t only +3.2% YoY (and +0.4% QoQ) in constant currency — demand is still soft, and margins gave way as TCS resumed hiring. Numbers. INR revenue Rs 72,275 cr (+13.9% YoY, +2.2% QoQ); USD revenue $7,624 mn (flat QoQ, +2.7% YoY). Net profit Rs 13,349 cr (+4.6% YoY). Operating m","doc_kind":"concall","kind":"written summary"},{"field":"improved","statement":"TCS's annualized AI services revenue grew by 13.6% quarter-on-quarter to reach $2.6 billion.","quote":"At the end of Q1 FY27, it stands at $2.6 billion in annualized revenue, which is up 13.6% QoQ.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/TCS_CORPCS_15072026193646_SEInt15072026_Signed.pdf","page":3.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"improved","statement":"The company achieved sequential growth in client additions across several revenue tiers, including the $10 million+, $5 million+, and $1 million+ bands.","quote":"We maintained healthy client additions across $10 million+, $5 million+, and $1 million+ revenue bands on a sequential basis.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/TCS_CORPCS_15072026193646_SEInt15072026_Signed.pdf","page":4.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"deteriorated","statement":"The company's operating margins decreased by 130 basis points compared to the previous quarter, mainly because of wage increases.","quote":"Fifth, our operating margins stood at 24%, down 130 bps sequentially, primarily due to wage hikes.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/TCS_CORPCS_15072026193646_SEInt15072026_Signed.pdf","page":4.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"deteriorated","statement":"The Life Sciences and Healthcare business segment experienced a decline during the quarter.","quote":"Life Sciences and Healthcare saw a decline this quarter. However, core demand for AI transformation, automation and compliance initiatives is intact.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/TCS_CORPCS_15072026193646_SEInt15072026_Signed.pdf","page":10.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"outlook","statement":"Management has a positive outlook for the manufacturing sector due to several new contract wins during the quarter.","quote":"However, our outlook remains positive for manufacturing based on multiple net new deal wins signed this quarter.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/TCS_CORPCS_15072026193646_SEInt15072026_Signed.pdf","page":10.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"guidance","statement":"The company aims to reach an operating margin exit rate of over 25% as soon as possible.","quote":"We want to exit at 25% plus and strive to achieve it sooner rather than later.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/TCS_CORPCS_15072026193646_SEInt15072026_Signed.pdf","page":23.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"demand","statement":"Demand for artificial intelligence is active across various areas, including IT operations, software engineering, modernization, business process transformation, and enterprise platform implementation.","quote":"AI demand continues across IT operations, software engineering, modernization, business process transformation, and enterprise platform implementation.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/TCS_CORPCS_15072026193646_SEInt15072026_Signed.pdf","page":6.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"costs","statement":"Annual salary increments for the global workforce reduced the company's margins by 170 basis points in the first quarter.","quote":"In Q1, we rolled out annual increments for our global workforce, which impacted margins by 170 bps.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/TCS_CORPCS_15072026193646_SEInt15072026_Signed.pdf","page":5.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"costs","statement":"Clients in the Consumer Business Group focused on managing their rising costs due to inflationary pressures and geopolitical uncertainties.","quote":"In this environment, client priorities were focused on managing their increasing costs.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/TCS_CORPCS_15072026193646_SEInt15072026_Signed.pdf","page":9.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"margins","statement":"The operating margin for the quarter decreased by 130 basis points sequentially to 24%.","quote":"Fifth, our operating margins stood at 24%, down 130 bps sequentially, primarily due to wage hikes.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/TCS_CORPCS_15072026193646_SEInt15072026_Signed.pdf","page":4.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"margins","statement":"The company typically faces margin headwinds in the first quarter and aims to progressively increase its operating margin to exit at over 25%.","quote":"Ashwin, usually, we take a big headwind upfront in Q1, and we inch up through the quarter. We want to exit at 25% plus and strive to achieve it sooner rather than later.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/TCS_CORPCS_15072026193646_SEInt15072026_Signed.pdf","page":23.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"orders","statement":"TCS achieved a total contract value of $9.5 billion in the first quarter, which included an $800 million mega deal with SKF.","quote":"We delivered a TCV of $9.5 billion, including net new AI-led business transformation deals such as, US$ 800 million mega deal with SKF; 6th mega deal win in the last 5 quarters","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/TCS_CORPCS_15072026193646_SEInt15072026_Signed.pdf","page":3.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"orders","statement":"TCS secured a major $800 million global AI-driven business transformation contract with SKF to redesign its enterprise operations.","quote":"We announced a landmark US$800 million global AI-led business transformation deal with SKF for redesigning their enterprise operations around an intelligent digital core.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/TCS_CORPCS_15072026193646_SEInt15072026_Signed.pdf","page":10.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"debt","statement":"TCS maintained strong cash conversion at 93% of net income, with invested funds totaling $5.3 billion at the end of the period.","quote":"Our cash conversion remained strong at 93% of net income. Invested funds at the end of the period stood at $5.3 billion.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/TCS_CORPCS_15072026193646_SEInt15072026_Signed.pdf","page":6.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"initiatives","statement":"TCS introduced the SovereignSecure Cloud for Europe to meet the demand from governments and regulated businesses for compliant and AI-ready cloud infrastructure.","quote":"We also launched TCS SovereignSecure CloudTM for Europe, directly addressing rising demand from governments and regulated enterprises for compliance, sovereign, and AI-ready cloud infrastructure.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/TCS_CORPCS_15072026193646_SEInt15072026_Signed.pdf","page":4.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"industry","statement":"Making technology choices across the AI stack has become more difficult for enterprises because of the rapid pace of technological change.","quote":"I think in the AI world today, I think making technology decisions across the Infrastructure to Intelligence stack is becoming much more challenging, because the technology is frequently changing so fast","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/TCS_CORPCS_15072026193646_SEInt15072026_Signed.pdf","page":21.0,"kind":"extracted"}],"kpis":[{"kpi":"Headcount","value":593798.0,"unit":"associates","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/TCS_CORPCS_15072026193646_SEInt15072026_Signed.pdf","page":8}]}},{"q":"FY27Q2","ql":"Q2 FY27","basis":"consolidated","label":"Good","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/xbrl/INTEGRATED_FILING_INDAS_1734607_08102026100810_WEB.xml","ev":{"ts":"2026-10-08T15:40:12","src":"NSE announcement","day":3.9},"docs":[{"k":"result","t":"Outcome of Board Meeting","u":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/TCS_CORPCS_08102026153124_Post_BM_SE_Letter_fin.pdf","ts":"2026-10-08T15:40"},{"k":"press","t":"Press Release","u":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/TCS_CORPCS_08102026154325_PressReleaseletter.pdf","ts":"2026-10-08T15:43"},{"k":"call","t":"Analysts/Institutional Investor Meet/Con. Call Updates","u":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/TCS_CORPCS_08102026223847_SEInt09072026_signed.pdf","ts":"2026-10-08T22:38"}],"cm":{"items":[{"field":"improved","statement":"The consumer business as well as energy, resources, and utilities segments showed sequential improvements over the prior quarter.","quote":"Consumer business and energy resources and utilities showed an improvement compared to the previous quarter.","doc_kind":"concall","url":"https://www.perplexity.ai/finance/TCS.NS/earnings?eventId=706973","page":1.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"improved","statement":"IT services LTM attrition decreased by 30 basis points sequentially to reach 13.3%.","quote":"LTM attrition in IT services reduced by 30 basis points sequentially to 13.3%.","doc_kind":"concall","url":"https://www.perplexity.ai/finance/TCS.NS/earnings?eventId=706973","page":3.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"deteriorated","statement":"The consumer business recorded a sequential revenue decline of 0.7% and a year-on-year drop of 1% due to ongoing macroeconomic pressures.","quote":"Consumer business declined by 0.7% sequentially and 1% year-on-year. Retail and consumer products remain sensitive to inflation, energy cost, and selective consumer spending.","doc_kind":"concall","url":"https://www.perplexity.ai/finance/TCS.NS/earnings?eventId=706973","page":3.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"deteriorated","statement":"Revenue in the energy, resources, and utilities segment declined by 0.5% sequentially.","quote":"Energy, resources, and utilities declined 0.5% sequentially. Although investments in grid modernization resilience, cybersecurity, asset optimization, and AI-enabled operations remain relevant.","doc_kind":"concall","url":"https://www.perplexity.ai/finance/TCS.NS/earnings?eventId=706973","page":3.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"outlook","statement":"Management expects growth momentum to continue over the medium term based on deal TCV, pipeline, and ongoing client discussions.","quote":"But on a medium-term basis, looking at the TCV, looking at the pipeline, and the client conversations that we are having, we are confident the growth momentum will continue.","doc_kind":"concall","url":"https://www.perplexity.ai/finance/TCS.NS/earnings?eventId=706973","page":4.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"outlook","statement":"Management anticipates a stronger performance in the consumer business next quarter driven by seasonal factors.","quote":"In consumer business, definitely we are expecting next quarter to be a better quarter because it is now, again for them seasonally, Q3 is the important quarter for the consumer business.","doc_kind":"concall","url":"https://www.perplexity.ai/finance/TCS.NS/earnings?eventId=706973","page":7.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"demand","statement":"The overall demand environment remains broadly unchanged from the previous quarter, with discretionary projects facing sustained scrutiny.","quote":"The demand environment has not materially changed since last quarter, and discretionary programs without near-term value remain under scrutiny.","doc_kind":"concall","url":"https://www.perplexity.ai/finance/TCS.NS/earnings?eventId=706973","page":1.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"pricing","statement":"TCS is securing improved pricing on AI-led contracts, while overall revenue per employee shows only a minor change.","quote":"At the same time, we are seeing better pricing on the AI revenues which we are generating. If you take the revenue per employee, you would see there's a slight reduction, not a significant one.","doc_kind":"concall","url":"https://www.perplexity.ai/finance/TCS.NS/earnings?eventId=706973","page":6.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"costs","statement":"TCS increased investments in strategic partnerships, M&A initiatives, and niche talent acquisition during the quarter.","quote":"In Q2, we made investments in strategic partnerships, M&A related initiatives, and hiring of niche talent.","doc_kind":"concall","url":"https://www.perplexity.ai/finance/TCS.NS/earnings?eventId=706973","page":2.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"costs","statement":"The company expanded its bench capacity and increased subcontractor usage to support near-term skill requirements.","quote":"As we build future capacity and navigate demand transitions, we have invested in a higher bench and increased hiring of subcontractors to meet near-term skills and delivery requirements.","doc_kind":"concall","url":"https://www.perplexity.ai/finance/TCS.NS/earnings?eventId=706973","page":2.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"margins","statement":"Operating margins remained stable at 24% as TCS continues to balance profitability with growth investments.","quote":"Our operating margins remained stable sequentially at 24%. Consistent with our philosophy to drive long-term profitable growth, we continue to prioritize investments for growth.","doc_kind":"concall","url":"https://www.perplexity.ai/finance/TCS.NS/earnings?eventId=706973","page":2.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"margins","statement":"The integration and valuation impact of the MHP acquisition is expected to create a margin headwind of approximately 50 basis points.","quote":"The acquisition-related valuation, particularly in MHP, is likely to impact by about 50 basis points, depending on the timing of closure and when the integration starts.","doc_kind":"concall","url":"https://www.perplexity.ai/finance/TCS.NS/earnings?eventId=706973","page":5.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"capacity","statement":"TCS expanded its workforce capacity globally, reaching a total headcount of 598,056 associates.","quote":"This quarter, we continue to invest in future-ready talent, onboarding top talent globally, taking our workforce to 598,056 associates.","doc_kind":"concall","url":"https://www.perplexity.ai/finance/TCS.NS/earnings?eventId=706973","page":3.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"orders","statement":"TCS closed Q2 with an order book TCV of $9.6 billion, excluding major upcoming transactions like Porsche and Best Buy.","quote":"TCV for the quarter was at $9.6 billion. This excludes the Porsche and Best Buy deals.","doc_kind":"concall","url":"https://www.perplexity.ai/finance/TCS.NS/earnings?eventId=706973","page":1.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"debt","statement":"TCS maintained solid cash generation with cash conversion at 102.2% of net income and total invested funds reaching $5.98 billion.","quote":"Our cash conversion remains strong at 102.2% of net income, and invested funds at the end of the period stood at $5.98 billion.","doc_kind":"concall","url":"https://www.perplexity.ai/finance/TCS.NS/earnings?eventId=706973","page":2.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"initiatives","statement":"Annualized revenue from AI offerings crossed $3.1 billion, accounting for over 10% of total company revenue.","quote":"Annualized AI revenue reached $3.1 billion and crossed 10% of our overall revenue.","doc_kind":"concall","url":"https://www.perplexity.ai/finance/TCS.NS/earnings?eventId=706973","page":1.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"initiatives","statement":"TCS introduced domain-specific AI solutions and launched physical AI innovation labs in Bengaluru and Pune.","quote":"We also launched TCS ADD AgentHub for drug discovery, domain-specific agentic control planes, and new physical AI capabilities, including autonomous engineering lab powered by NVIDIA in Bengaluru and an AI-first lights-out factory lab in Pune.","doc_kind":"concall","url":"https://www.perplexity.ai/finance/TCS.NS/earnings?eventId=706973","page":1.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"industry","statement":"Financial services clients continue prioritizing investments in AI, regulatory platforms, cyber resilience, and operational efficiency.","quote":"Clients continue to invest in AI, risk and regulatory modernization, cyber resilience, data platforms, and operational efficiency.","doc_kind":"concall","url":"https://www.perplexity.ai/finance/TCS.NS/earnings?eventId=706973","page":3.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"tone","statement":"positive","quote":"We remain confident that TCS is positioned well to convert the opportunities in our pipeline into growth as client spending improve and enterprise AI adoption scales.","doc_kind":"concall","url":"https://www.perplexity.ai/finance/TCS.NS/earnings?eventId=706973","page":8.0,"kind":"extracted"}],"kpis":[{"kpi":"Constant-currency revenue growth QoQ %","value":0.5,"unit":"%","doc_kind":"concall","url":"https://www.perplexity.ai/finance/TCS.NS/earnings?eventId=706973","page":1},{"kpi":"Constant-currency revenue growth YoY %","value":2.8,"unit":"%","doc_kind":"concall","url":"https://www.perplexity.ai/finance/TCS.NS/earnings?eventId=706973","page":1},{"kpi":"Deal wins TCV (US$ mn)","value":9.6,"unit":"US$ billion","doc_kind":"concall","url":"https://www.perplexity.ai/finance/TCS.NS/earnings?eventId=706973","page":1},{"kpi":"EBIT margin %","value":24.0,"unit":"%","doc_kind":"concall","url":"https://www.perplexity.ai/finance/TCS.NS/earnings?eventId=706973","page":2},{"kpi":"Attrition %","value":13.3,"unit":"%","doc_kind":"concall","url":"https://www.perplexity.ai/finance/TCS.NS/earnings?eventId=706973","page":3},{"kpi":"Headcount","value":598056.0,"unit":"associates","doc_kind":"concall","url":"https://www.perplexity.ai/finance/TCS.NS/earnings?eventId=706973","page":3}]}}],"fdb":{"eq":[{"qe":"2012-06-30","basis":"consolidated","rev":14868.7,"pbt":4256.6,"